  "details": "I dont know if this is a bug or not but after testing with different toggle set ups in the animator by using one parameter and using different controls in the expression menu, if i turn on one toggle with say int value 8 and it has to equal 8 but then the off state is 2, then turn on my second toggle using equals 9 as my entry condition and 3 as my exit condition if both toggles are on and i turn off one it also turns off the second toggle off as well. Ive even specified on my exit condition for both toggles with different int values and still it turns both off regardless if the condition was met or not and by the way ive used the parameter driver to temporally switch it to the exit condition for that specific toggle\n\ni have manged to get it to work on to parameters but i would of thought you could do it on all on one parameter",
